without_editor_info theorem checks309 : ∀ i : Fin 75, jointEnvelopeFastCheck (envelopes309 i) pi rho 13 1160 1036 2 (values 1 32 i) (certificatesC309 i) (certificatesD309 i) := by decide +kernel

